window.products.push({"id":183036,"name":"Balloon Pump Electric, Balloon Pump Kit 600W 110V Inflator Air Blower Cute Cartoon Elephant Portable Balloon Air Pump with Tying Tool Dot Glue for Par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bIk2GQhFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Easy to Use】It’s a great balloon machine and saves time compared with the traditional ways of balloon inflation.Just push the inflation spout down to start the pump and inflate the balloon, release the spout when the balloon is the right size, save your breath and spare your tired arms from the hassle of using hand balloon pumps.100 balloons in less than 30 mins and help you make a balloon arch or fill the ceiling in no time, spend less time decorating and more time celebrating! 【Durable and Cute】Upgraded electric motor and shell material make it more durable and high efficiency. 600W electric balloon pump have long-lasting service life. Only weights 530g, balloon pump comes with a cable compartment to store cables. You can take it to the event place easily and its cute elephant shape will add to the festive atmosphere from balloon inflation machine. This balloon pump electric is portable to office, classroom, garden, and etc. Nice-looking and cute! 【Widely Compatible】The balloon air pump fits all kind of latex balloon,decoration balloons and all kinds of round balloons,comes with a extra small tip that can be used for foil balloons,but not for long,twist,cartoon balloons. Noted electric balloon pump only fills the balloons with air, not helium or hydrogen.Only for countries with rated voltage of 110-120V, 50/60Hz,such as USA,Canada,and Mexico.Must connect power converter to use in countries with a rated voltage of 220-240 volts. 【Meet Many Occasions】The electric balloon pump can easily create a warm atmospher, great for parties, birthday parties,wedding, graduation, Christmas, anniversary, Easter and any special celebration activity. You will have an unforgettable party! A perfect baby shower gift for family and friends too! 【Note】The Balloon air pump is very fast and usually takes only a few seconds to fill a balloon. Please press the switch button to 0 to start manual mode.Try it a few times and you'll get the hang of it. It's really easy to use when you know the right way to use it. Suggest you to pause few minutes when sustained use 5 minutes to allow the machine to cool down.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bIk2GQhFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AcmyslaT","source_asin":"B0BLCXW3JK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCXW3JK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCXW3JK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
