window.products.push({"id":183094,"name":"Modern Farmhouse Sliding Barn Door Storage Cabinet, Coffee Bar Cabinet, Floor Buffet Sideboard Entryway Cupboard with Adjustable Shelf for Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VIHpAeXIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The organization is made easy with the charming entryway cabinet. It’s made of manufactured wood, features two-tone rustic and white finish. Two shelves behind the doors provide ample storage space to assist in organizing busy areas. With black metal sliding rails accents for a smooth touch. A fantastic assistant to the modern household, the cabinet adds value to any space. Features: With smooth surface is easy to clean and maintain. 2 adjustable shelves offer ample storage space for all your items. Sturdy construction endows the buffet to withstand up to 250 lbs. Attractive barn door can effortlessly slide on the rail for easy push and pull. It's the best gift choice for mother and friends on Birthdays, Mothers Day, and Christmas Day. Specification: Material: Manufactured Wood Color: Rustic, White Overall dimension: 31.7\"(L) x 15.7\"(W) x 32.5\"(H) Package Includes: 1 x Buffet Cabinet 1 x Instruction 1 x Accessories Bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VIHpAeXIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"URKNO","source_asin":"B09GJWFVFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GJWFVFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GJWFVFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":183095,"name":"LEUNG 36 x 24 Inch LED Bathroom Mirror, Rectangle Wall Mounted Vanity Mirror with 3 Colors Dimmable Light Anti-Fog Touch Switch Makeup Backlit Mirror(","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XXzse+ziL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Smart Dimming Mirror】Change the color temperature by pressing the button: warm light (3000K), natural light (4000K) and white light (6000K). Stepless dimming design. Click the switch button to adjust to the desired color temperature, and then long-press the switch button, the light gradually dims. Long press the switch button again, the light gradually brightens. The mirror will remain in the last used state, no need to adjust the brightness. Find the brightness that suits you. 【Led Bathroom Mirror】The bathroom mirror has additional anti-shatter film (installed at the factory), not easy to break. Even if it is broken, it will not be broken into pieces. Ensure your safety. After turning it on again, the mirror will remain in the last used state, without the need to re-adjust the brightness. The fusion of technology and life will add surprises to your bathroom. 【Anti-Fog Vanity Mirror】Worried about the fog in the warm shower? Our wall-mounted mirror has an anti-fog function. The power switch and the anti-fog switch are controlled separately, and the anti-fog is switched on and off as needed, which is safe and energy-saving. Say goodbye to haziness and enjoy a warm bath. 【Energy-Saving & Durable】Using a double-layer lamp belt design, the life span can reach 100,000 hours (if you use it for 3 hours a day, it means you can use it for 90 years). Input voltage 110-120V. CRI>90. IP>54. It is a great choice for your bathroom and bedroom. 【Packaging and Service】We are always committed to providing customers with the best quality products. After the rigorous drop, impact and heavy pressure tests, we have carried out a brand new package for the mirror. If you have any questions after receiving the product, please feel free to contact us. We will provide you with satisfactory service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XXzse+ziL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEUNG","source_asin":"B098TGDCZD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098TGDCZD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098TGDCZD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":183096,"name":"W Home Set 5-Pair Wooden Classic style Chopsticks, Assorted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ws95SuhKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These chopsticks are made from Japanese natural organic hardwood which is more durable and provides better heat insulation than other materials. A layer of natural lacquer coating adds beautiful shines and grips while protecting the chopsticks from corrosion at the same time. These chopsticks have a moderate length of 8. 86 inch/ 23 cm and a unique flower pattern at the end. Suitable for travelling, camping and any Asian-style family dinner party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ws95SuhKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"W Home","source_asin":"B0829SRN2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0829SRN2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0829SRN2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":183097,"name":"Edenbrook Hawthorne Faux Leather Headboard - Modern -Adjustable Height - Buttonless Tufting, Queen, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AV+B1N9dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the beautiful faux leather finish to the intricate square tufting, the  Edenbrook Hawthorne Headboard was hand crafted for your bedroom. Designed to convey a modern sophisticated feel, this headboard can easily attach to any bed base, frame, or wall to create a clean, polished look for your room. To maintain functionality and ensure versatility, this headboard has seven different adjustable height options between 34 and 46 inches. And don’t worry about setting it up,  Edenbrook headboards come with all included hardware hidden in a compartment on the back. Choose craftsmanship, choose ingenuity, choose mastery, choose  Edenbrook.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AV+B1N9dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Edenbrook","source_asin":"B09HYQ42WB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183097","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HYQ42WB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HYQ42WB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":183098,"name":"Top Plaza Chakra Prymaid Rose Quartz Green Aventurine Feng Shui Spiritual Reiki Healing Crystal Energy Statue Pyramid Figurines Decoration 1-1 1/4 Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sUovmDGZL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Meaning of the stones:Rose Quartz:Rose Quartz is the love stone! Adds positive love energy to relationships. Compassion and forgiveness. Calming, helps clear stored anger, resentment, jealousy, fears. Replaces negativity with harmony. Helps to balance upper four chakras and eases sexual/emotional imbalances. Enhances self-confidence and creativity. Aids kidneys and circulatory system, promotes release of impurities.Amethyst:Amethyst is a violet variety of quartz often used in jewelry.The ancient Greeks wore amethyst and made drinking vessels decorated with it in the belief that it would prevent intoxication. It is one of several forms of quartz. Amethyst is a semiprecious stone and is the traditional birthstone for February.Tiger eye:One who wears the tiger eye has the patience to wait for the most opportune moment and has great focus and determination. By wearing the gem, you will have the courage to fight negative energy whether it is illness or an outside influence. The harmony it brings is calming and helpful with meditation; meditations with the tiger eye stone will be complete with a calm inner being and total concentration.Green aventurine:Green Aventurine is known as the ?¡ãStone of Opportunity,?¡À thought to be the luckiest of all crystals, especially in manifesting prosperity and wealth, or for increasing favor in competitions or games of chance. Its winning energy makes it a great ally for boosting one??s chances in any situation - a first date, tax audit, even landing a promotion. One needs only to be near it to derive its benefits.White crystal: The white crystals are of the spiritual world that is sensed but not seen. White crystals are guides when we don??t know where we are going. They are the guides to understanding and knowledge that we don??t even know exists.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sUovmDGZL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Top Plaza","source_asin":"B01ITBXL5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ITBXL5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ITBXL5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":183099,"name":"Emile Henry Made In France Flame Braiser, 12\", Charcoal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yrsLGpmYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since 1850, Emile Henry has produced in France a large range of high quality ceramic cooking utensils. With a 10 year guarantee, our products are made from natural materials and have been designed and manufactured in France, in Southern Burgundy. Controlled production, without waste, is part of our daily commitment: the CO2 expelled from our workshops is particularly low thanks to our modern firing techniques that require less energy. The waste in general is recycled and the water used in production is filtered and used again in the production process.Our dishes have always been produced in France, in Marcigny in the south of Burgundy: it is a tradition and savoir-faire which has been handed down from generation to generation. Each worker prepares his moulds, produces his dishes and signs each one with his initials. We are proud of this responsibility entrusted to each of our workers, which is a pledge of quality for all our production.The large base makes cooking easy, you can brown your meat then deglaze and reduce your sauces. Made from Flame ceramic, entirely natural, our braiser diffuses the heat gently and evenly, keeping all the vitamins and nutritional qualities of your ingredients. All Emile Henry products are made in France and offer a ten years guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yrsLGpmYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B00T4AOD3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T4AOD3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T4AOD3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
