window.products.push({"id":183136,"name":"434 Pcs Kitchen Pantry Labels for Food Containers with DIY Blank Labels, 3 Sizes Preprinted Minimalist Waterproof Pantry Kitchen Labels, Pantry Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817cEJqeBtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【434 Pcs Minimalist Food Container Label Set】Pantry kitchen label stickers sets include 403 pcs minimalist pantry labels and 31 pcs DIY blank labels. And includes a checklist(front and back), the checklist is arranged in alphabetical order. Each waterproof kitchen pantry label has a corresponding location, and you can easily get the label you need by a list, saving you more time, and bringing more conveniences, making organizing more simple and fun. 【Premium-quality Organization Labels】Minimalist kitchen pantry labels are made of high-quality PVC material, waterproof, oil resistant, alcohol resistant, good tear-resistant, and good stickiness and long-lasting. These pantry labels are adhesive-backed and can be easily peeled off, and will not leave traces or damage to the item. There are 3 sizes of kitchen pantry labels, 2.5 × 2.5 inches,1.8 × 2.5 inches, and 1.6 × 1.6 inches, labels can stick on jars, cups, bottles, boxes, and bins. 【Come with DIY Blank Labels】Kitchen container label stickers include 31pcs blank labels. There are three different sizes of blank labels, if you can't find the required label, you can make your own label. Simply write your own tag name on the label. Various blank labels can satisfy your different usages, and provide you with more choices. This is a good choice supplement for your home. 【Perfect Organization for Home】These kitchen organization labels are ideal reminders in daily life, these labels can help you better organize your kitchen, pantry, and food cabinet. The organizing kitchen pantry labels include commonly used labels such as cheese powder, cranberries, pasta, bbq seasoning, black pepper, cayenne, cooking oil, cumin, curry, steak seasoning, bread, coffee beans, red beans, pistachios, milk, fruits, cookies, condiments, peas, potato chips, and so on. 【Easy to Read】The kitchen pantry organizing labels are designed with a simple and clean design. White label paper is printed with beautiful black text, the font adopts a bold black font design, beautiful and simple font style. Simple and clear decoration makes your home more attractive. Minimalist pantry organization labels are used for the perfection of every space in your kitchen pantry for organization and functions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817cEJqeBtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cludoo","source_asin":"B0BTCQ9CNJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTCQ9CNJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTCQ9CNJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
