window.products.push({"id":183176,"name":"Stainless Steel Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Tumbler with Splashproof Lid, 30 oz - Maximum Ice Retention for Cold Drinks - Double Walled Heat Insulati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OVS3mem5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Way to Ensure Every Adventure is a Good Adventure Let’s face it; we’ve all experienced drinking beverages that neutralize to the temperature of our surrounding environment. Whether it is an ice cold drink becoming hot on a summer day or a steaming hot drink becoming luke-warm in the midst of winter. Cheap single wall cups are frustrating to deal with, so why use them? Put a Bit of Oomph in Your Drinkware Start your adventure out right with this affordable, double wall, vacuum-sealed stainless steel tumbler. One sip and you’ll understand why double wall construction is preferred by almost anyone who uses it for its temperature conservation properties. Constructed out of 18/8 Stainless Steel, this tumbler is designed to maximize ice retention, every sip. This tumbler is not cold on quality… no spills, leaks or luke-warm drinks here even after hundreds of uses. Want two tumblers for you and a buddy? Need a different size for another type of activity? Check out all of our line of tumbler size offerings so you get exactly what works best for you: · 30 oz: Great for longer excursions where beverage supply may be limited · 20 oz: Excellent for casual daily use around the workplace · 10 oz: Perfect for around the house and backyard With three popular sizes to choose from, you’ll look forward to every sip. (Makes the perfect gift, too!) Click Add to Cart to upgrade your sipping experience today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OVS3mem5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stronghold Accessories","source_asin":"B01HQ2QJ5E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HQ2QJ5E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HQ2QJ5E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
