window.products.push({"id":183180,"name":"Dutsekk 32x24 Inch LED Bathroom Mirror Anti-Fog Dimmable IP44 Waterproof, Bathroom Vanity Mirror with Lights Wall Mounted, Touch Switch Control, 3 Col","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cVsnDbYuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Advanced Anti-dead Bead Technology] -- Our led light strip adopts high color rendering LED chips, low light decay and high brightness. Using soft insulating rubber sleeve, insulated and flame-retardant, to protect your safety. Adopting safety copper core wire, better conductivity and fast heat dissipation, stable current, protect the lamp beads from burning out. If one lamp bead does not emit light, the others lamp beads will glow normally, it will not affect the entire light strip. [Intelligent Anti-Fog Technology & Wall Switch Control] -- Our led bathroom mirror adopts intelligent anti-fog technology. Using high-quality PET defogging pad material. The independent defogging switch allows you to turn on and off the defogger according to your needs, safer and energy-saving. Helping to keep always clear reflection image, no longer worry about wiping down your mirror after a shower. Supports plug in and hardwire. Wall switch can control the light and the defogger on/off. [Dimmable & 3 Color Temperature] -- The led bathroom mirror is dimmable, long press to adjust brightness. Select warm/natural/white light by short touching. You can turn off the button light by long pressing when turning off the mirror light, without disturbing your sleep when you mount the mirror in your bedroom. [Aviation Aluminum Alloy Frame] -- The led bathroom mirror frame adopts aviation aluminum alloy material, which is sturdy and durable. U-shaped hanger, elegant and easy to install. Support horizontal or vertical installation. Please do not remove the corner protector until the installation is complete(two people are recommended to operate the installation). [Upgraded Packaging] -- The improved packaging has passed drop test, impact test, heavy pressure test. Is greatly reduces damage during transportation. If there are any problems, please feel free to contact us. We will response with the best solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cVsnDbYuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dutsekk","source_asin":"B08RN9ZJW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RN9ZJW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RN9ZJW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
