window.products.push({"id":183365,"name":"wondux Gel-Infused Shredded Memory Foam Pillow for Sleeping, Certipur-US Certified Adjustable Pillow for Side Neck Stomach Sleepers and Shoulder Pain ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515s5sqw+mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🆕Fully Adjustable for Better Alignment - Our memory foam pillow for sleeping combines cloud-like comfort with personal customization for every type of sleeper. It comes overfilled to put you in control of your comfort. It’s easy to adjust fill as many times as you need to get the pillow right for you. Simply unzip the two covers, add or remove some of the fill to create individualized loft and support. 🆕A Unique Pillow Makes a Difference - Our unique middle foam layer works between the comfort bamboo top layer and the foam core to prevent the filling from clumping, shifting, or going flat, making the pillow smooth and well-shaped, making your neck and head more comfortably cradled. .Both layers are zippered for you to add or remove foam from the inside and wash easily. 🆕Enjoy the Ideal Balance of Soft and Firm - To take advantage of both memory foam pillow and down fill, we add smooth polyester fiber in the cooling gel memory foam to achieve an excellent combination of softness and neck support. This combination design makes the pillow well suited to side and back sleepers, as well as combination sleepers who rely on both of these positions. 🆕Keeps You Cooler Throughout the Night - It starts with a soft, hypoallergenic bamboo rayon cover that works to circulate air around the bed, so you never have to worry about overheating. Moreover, the middle transition layer provides extra air space between foam particles and the outer cover, making it more breathable than a traditional shredded memory foam pillow. We also injected the shredded foam with cool gel to bring the pillow a new level of cooling and temperature regulation. 🆕Your comfort is guaranteed - We want you to have complete confidence in the quality and safety of our products. Our quality materials undergo strict lab testing to meet CertiPUR-US and Oeko-tex rigorous standards for emissions, content, performance, and durability. If you are not satisfied with Wondux for any reason, contact us directly and get an instant reply to return the pillow for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515s5sqw+mL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wondux","source_asin":"B08LMW6KDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LMW6KDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LMW6KDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
