window.products.push({"id":183466,"name":"FirsTime & Co. Mason Planks Wall Mirror, 31.5\"H x 24\"W, Aged White & Gray Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rqicu94-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You don’t want your mirror to simply reflect yourself – it should also reflect your style! We hear you. Standing 31.5” high and 24” wide, the Mason Farmhouse Planks Mirror by FirsTime & Co. gives off a rustic farmhouse look. The solid wood frame alternates between aged white finished and distressed gray finished planks. The Mason Planks Mirror includes hanging hardware to be hung vertically, or rest atop a table or shelf. Finding the right mirror to suit your style has never been easier thanks to our wide range of FirsTime & Co. home living products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rqicu94-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FirsTime & Co.","source_asin":"B097FNV82X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097FNV82X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097FNV82X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":183467,"name":"Saxophone Wall Decor Art Musician 3D Sculpture","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":295.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uMf6jszeL._AC_SL1480_.jpg","description":"Metal Wall Decor Art of Saxophone Musician. Our music room wall decor is a wall decoration large music wall art that you will love owning. This large music themed wall art is modern and cool. It is a full 30 inches high and 17 inches wide so it will display extremely well anywhere you place it. The music inspired wall art will make you the envy of everyone who sees it. While music wall art decals have to be replaced all the time, this cool music wall art lasts a lifetime. It's cut from a single piece of steel so there aren't any bends to collect dirt and dust and no welds that will break over time. Music related wall art can be placed in most any room of your house. It can even be hung in bathrooms and/or outside because this metal wall art decor doesn't rust either.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uMf6jszeL._AC_SL1480_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Backer Art","source_asin":"B014GCOK4Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014GCOK4Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014GCOK4Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":183468,"name":"Manual Inspirational Collection 26 X 36-Inch Wall Hanging and Finial Rod, Sunrise with Verse by Thomas Kinkade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817QC5usI5L._AC_SL1373_.jpg","description":"Manual Woodworkers and Weavers brings you a fresh way to display your favorite images and showcase inspiring message with their collection of hanging wall art with included finial hanging rod. Although Thomas Lemuel Oates started Manual Woodworkers and Weavers in 1932, the story goes back further. The roots of the company can be found in Oates' entrepreneurial spirit. He and his brother used to farm the mountain areas of Bat Cave in western North Carolina. They would also help their mother find materials for her crafts. The sons began to make wooden whistles, buckets and bird-houses. They would sell their wares along with her crafts to the people from Charlotte that came through in their horse-drawn buggies on the way to the mountains. Later, Thomas worked at the Ashville Postcard Company. When the Depression hit, he lost his job, but it inspired him to go into business and sell crafts, like cornhusk dolls and woven pieces, that were produced by the local women. He had learned about the wholesale business while working at Ashville. He built a waterwheel to generate electricity at a mill, began making product and opened shop. Over the years, he expanded the company. His son, Lemuel Oates, who would next manage the company, says he worked in the business from a young age. He explains the products were made from cotton scraps left over from making socks. Half-inch circles would be looped together to form a variety of products. Lemuel Oates went to college and then settled in Richmond. In December 1973, he returned to Bat Cave and took over the company. In 2007 his son Travis and his daughter, Molly Oates Sherrill, took over the business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817QC5usI5L._AC_SL1373_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manual Woodworker","source_asin":"B000STA0PI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000STA0PI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000STA0PI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
