window.products.push({"id":183502,"name":"WORHE Soap Dish True Natural Marble, Soap Sponge Holder for Bathroom Tub Shower Kitchen Sink, Handcraft Nero Marquina Marble Oval Soap Tray Case Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J2xzVFB+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[REAL SOLID MARBLE] This black marble soap dish is made from real solid marble instead of marble style resin or plastics soap holder. Each of piece is handmade, carefully cut and well-done high grade polished by our skilled stonemason, from original marble stone. They could be pass centuries unless you break it by force. [WATERPROOF] Waterproof stone saver is perfect for addition to your bathroom or kitchen. Also easy to clean the rest of soap or wash by water or damp soap and dry easily to avoid soap becoming mushy. As a sponge holder placing beside the sink, add an elegant view to your kitchen. [ANTI-SLIP] 4 anti-slip pads are applied under this soap tray, not only protect your tub or bathroom countertop surface from scratching and moss, but also avoid slip around or off the bathroom vanity top. [MUTI APPLICATION] Manualism and elegant ellipse piece is both beautiful and functional. Excellent size soap case for bath tub, shower, bathroom kitchen sink and countertop. Besides that, they could be used as a small storage tray for keys, candles, jewelry, small tools etc. If you want, you could choose it as an exquisite gift for housewarming, birthday and holidays. [ABSOLUTELY NATURAL] Natural solid black marble is used, giving a smooth touch as well as the ability of waterproof, fireproof, radiation free and environmentally friendly. This marble towel hook showcases the beauty craftsman’s artwork. Please note that the patterns and colors will varies and no 2 would be exactly same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J2xzVFB+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WORHE","source_asin":"B0C5HTQB33","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5HTQB33","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5HTQB33","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":183503,"name":"LILY BEE WRAP Reusable Sandwich Bags | Plastic Free Bees Wax Bag | Sustainable, Biodegradable & Silicone Free | Easy to Clean (Geometric Snack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i01tGMrbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LILY BEE WRAP was born from a desire to create an easy, eco-friendly food storage option that worked well without sacrificing beauty. We hate using plastic (especially when it’s only for single use) so we started looking for alternatives. After trying just beeswax and experimenting with a few recipes online that didn't really work we decided to create our own eco-friendly reusable snack bags. We finally found something that worked, and are excited to share it! Ideal for sandwiches and snacks of all kinds such as carrots, grapes, cheese, popcorn, chips, nuts and anything else you can think of. They are incredibly easy to clean, simply wash with water and reuse again and again. We hand craft each of our products with natural materials, love and the intention of bringing more joy and beauty to your kitchen and family. LilyBee Wrap is family owned and operated, and we are delighted to share this little piece of our family with yours. The natural beauty of our location, Hawke’s Bay, New Zealand, cannot help but inspire. We hand select all of our gorgeous fabric (usually with our baby in tow) and often wonder if the bees we see around our home help make the wax that is so lovingly applied to each wrap. Let's do good by the environment. We all deserve a little more beauty in the kitchen and our lives. Join the LilyBee family and use less plastic. It's small steps like these that help change the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i01tGMrbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LILY BEE WRAP","source_asin":"B07SB95ZS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SB95ZS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SB95ZS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
