window.products.push({"id":183530,"name":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc. Oversized Bedding Quilt Set Lightweight, Summer Farmhouse Coverlet Bedspread 2-Piece with One Matching sham (68 in Wide x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1yJ3ndFvGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to update your bedroom with a quality quilt bedding spread without spending a lot of money? Our oversized quilt sets fit the bill. These light-weight quilt bedding sets are high-quality, beautifully embroidered in free motion pattern and comes with matching shams. These quilt sets are made with our signature microfiber soft fabric that is light weight, double-brushed for extra softness, shrinkage free, fade resistant.  You will wake up fresh and well rested with these cozy bedding set. Twin / twin xl size quilt set is a 2-piece set and contains one quilt: 69 inch wide x 98 inch long and one quilted sham: 20 in wide x 26 in long. Both quilts and shams are quilted on both sides. Shams have an envelope enclosure and completely hide your pillows. We offer hundreds of options, a highly customer focused customer service. These quilted king size bedspreads are lightweight and oversized. High quality craftsmanship & signature soft fabric: Woven with double-brushed soft microfiber yarns, this quilt bedding set will continue to soften with each wash. This quilt set has tight embroidered stitching. There are so many ways these quilt sets can be used. You can layer it to add depth, or you can simply use it on its own. whether it is farmhouse bedding, boho style, or modern décor, this oversized king bedspread will instantly transform your bedroom. Multi-purpose and versatile. These oversized light-weight quilt sets can be used on their own or as a layer with other bedding. These king and california king size quilt bedding sets and bedspreads can be used in any type of décor. You can quite easily use them in simply chic urban loft setting, farmhouse bedding, French country décor, bohemian bedding style, or in simple minimalist setting. It comes in a vacuum sealed box. Easy Care and fade resistant. our quilt bedding sets are wrinkle, fade and pilling Resistant. These coverlet sets are high-quality and made with our signature double-brushed luxurious and soft microfiber fabric, providing a substantially higher smoothness and softness. They are machine washable and will continue to get softer with each wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1yJ3ndFvGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B076V69F76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076V69F76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076V69F76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
