window.products.push({"id":183778,"name":"VivaTerra Origami Recycled Glass Vase | 5\" Dia. x 7.5\" H | GeometricGlass Vases for Floral Arrangements and Centerpieces | Modern Glass Vase for Your ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519ZX7L8PhL._AC_SL1126_.jpg","description":"The geometric surface on this Origami Recycled Glass Vase is reminiscent of a honeycomb pattern which highlights the rich color seen throughout. Add greens or simply place it unadorned as a textural accent on your mantel or shelf. We especially love it bedside paired with fragrant blooms. Handcrafted in Spain from smooth recycled glass for a striking look, this unique glass vase is a great way to display your decorative blooms, and it also works as a stunning standalone piece. The compelling geometric shape complements any existing decor, and it's easy to use in a variety of rooms. Place it anywhere from your kitchen table to your mantel for a simple, charming accent you and your guests will love. The 7.5 inch tall vase features an over all stout, organic shape and a lipped opening, perfect for displaying a few small blossoms. Available in a variety of color options, show off a single vase in your favorite color or mix and match the Origami vase with other shapes in our collection to create a show-stopping centerpiece. Made in Spain. Why we use recycled glass? Recycling glass saves energy! Making new glass means heating sand and other substances to 2,600 degrees. That requires a lot of energy and creates a lot of industrial pollution. One of the steps in glass recycling is to crush the glass and create a product called \"cullet.\" Making recycled glass products from cullet consumes 40% less energy than making new glass from raw materials, because cullet melts at a much lower temperature. It also allows post-consumer products to have a new life instead of ending up in landfills.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519ZX7L8PhL._AC_SL1126_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vivaterra","source_asin":"B09151YFQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09151YFQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09151YFQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
