window.products.push({"id":183785,"name":"Tellpet Dream Catchers Wall Decorations Blue Decor for Girls Boys","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YzXTJoOZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Dream Catcher Legend: Dreamcatcher comes from the 18th century. It is a traditional culture of Native Americans. They believe that a dreamcatcher capture dreams and bring blessings. Nightmares pass through the holes and out of the window. The good dreams are trapped in the web, and then slide down the feathers to the sleeping person. Now many people buy it as a gift to give their lovers or friends, send their sincere heart and blessings. Package: Assembled Handmade dreamcatcher r Material Dream Catcher made of natural feather through fumigation process, Natural Turquoise, Ethical conditions and harmony with nature Meaningful gifts for who you really care Great gift for kids, keep good dream down, perfect decoration for home and parties Diameter size: 8 inch, total length:23 inch Beautiful wall art ! Plus peaceful dreams. For Bedroom, Sitting room, Baby tent, Balcony, Party, Wedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YzXTJoOZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tellpet","source_asin":"B09BTNW1BZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BTNW1BZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BTNW1BZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
