window.products.push({"id":183827,"name":"Germany's Stoneline Xtreme Series Non-stick Non-Toxic Stone Coating Cookware 12.8\" Wok - 2016 Top of the line model, better taste food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516u+ajhZTL._AC_.jpg","description":"One wok, 32 cm / 12.8\" diameter, height: 9.2 cm/ 3.7\", one deluxe glass lid with sieve function, Benefit from the famous and unique Stoneline Xtreme coating and also from many comfortable possible applications of this line. Thanks to the pouring rim you can pour off or decant liquids cleanly. The lids have two integrated pouring sieves. Liquids are drained by the lid sieve so you can renounce the application of a sieve or a bowl from now on. The food can be served appetizing and practical directly in the pot or the pan. On the edge of the cookware is a support on both sides, in which you can put the lid. In this way, the removed lids cannot pollute the work surface as they can be put in the support and the excess liquid in the lid flows back into the cookware. We also include an extra quick release click handle. The main advantages of the STONELINE Xtreme cookware at a glance: Absolute scratch-proof STONELINE Xtreme non-stick coating, Optimal frying result and crispy fried meat, Best taste, Food cook on it would absolute taste better and just like cooking on real stone. Vitamin gentle cooking without fat and oil, Non-stick, no scorching, Easy to clean, Suitable for all cookers, even induction cookers, Extra strong, non-distorting base, Base thickness 4.5 mm This product is ovenproof up to 180 °C (356 °F) Material: die-cast aluminium with Stoneline Xtreme coating inside and powder coating outside. Tips for cleaning and maintenance: We recommend cleaning the cooking and bakeware with some water and a mild detergent before first use. Afterwards spread some drops of cooking oil with a cleaning tissue on the coating. For further use you can renounce the application of fat or oil! Thanks to the easy-clean-effect we recommend the cleaning by hand. Just wipe out the cookware with hot water, detergent and a soft sponge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516u+ajhZTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stoneline-Xtreme","source_asin":"B018FSNKUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-183827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018FSNKUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018FSNKUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
